Menu, ClearCNMenu, Add, Delete Clipnote #2, ClearCN2
Menu, ClearCNMenu, Add, Delete Clipnote #3, ClearCN3
Menu, ClearCNMenu, Add, Delete Clipnote #4, ClearCN4
